      "message": "feat(ui): setup eye in the browser; only the active setup is drawn by default\n\nEach setup row gets the browser eye. A setup other than the active one has\nits operation paths, work-offset triad and fixtures undrawn until its eye is\nturned on, which never activates it. View state only (like the other eyes):\nposting, simulation and collision checks are untouched.\n\nFixes #1494\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
